/target
gen/schemas/

# **The local override that makes the two-surfaces rule survive.** Cargo.toml reaches the five
# shared crates by revision so a stranger can build this; a developer with an Epoch checkout
# beside it puts a `paths` override here and builds against their local crates instead. The path
# is theirs, not this repository's, so it is never committed -- and a committed one would break
# every clone that does not happen to have Epoch in the same place.
/.cargo/config.toml
